 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Tool calls now receive schema validation before execution. Invalid arguments return a correction the model can use; valid arguments, including extra properties, pass through unchanged. Executors that previously validated inputs themselves now receive only schema-accepted input, so tools that relied on seeing malformed input to produce their own error message must move that guidance into the schema or tool description.
+
